# mauritius-fuel-prices.netlify.app was this site's first home. It now only
# redirects to https://fuel-prices.ramgolam.com (GitHub Pages). The Netlify project
# is not linked to this repo; deploy this folder by hand:
#   netlify deploy --prod --no-build --dir netlify-redirect --site mauritius-fuel-prices
# Files in this folder (the Google verification file) are served as they are; every
# other path 301s to the same path on fuel-prices.ramgolam.com, and Netlify passes
# the query string along. GitHub Pages serves pages with a trailing slash, so the
# two pages get it here to keep it to one hop.
/comparison  https://fuel-prices.ramgolam.com/comparison/  301
/history     https://fuel-prices.ramgolam.com/history/     301
/*           https://fuel-prices.ramgolam.com/:splat       301
